{
  "_note": "Discovery targets. These are all appointment-driven local service businesses, which is the shape the leak model actually fits: a missed call is lost revenue, a no-show is lost revenue, and nobody is following up. `industry` maps each to the priors in industries.json. `tier` lets you run a tight sweep (core) or a wide one (all).",
  "_fields": {
    "queries": "Text queries sent to Google Places. Each is combined with the --area you pass on the CLI.",
    "industry": "Which prior set in industries.json to score this with.",
    "tier": "core = strongest fit for the leak model, wide = still fits, run when you want volume."
  },

